==Trivia==
*First British organization to reach 1 million {{Abbr/USD}} in earnings.
*Them and [[Paper Rex]] share the title of second most earning organization of 2023 (Total Winnings: $645,000). <ref>{{cite web|url=https://liquipedia.net/valorant/Statistics/2023|title=Statistics 2023|date=2023-12-31|author=[[Liquipedia]]}}</ref>
*As of June 2023, they are the first team to win 2 VCT international events in a row, winning [[VCT/2023/LOCK_IN_São_Paulo|LOCK//IN São Paulo]] and [[VCT/2023/Masters|Masters Tokyo]].
*They are the only team to qualify for every Champions tournament since its inception.
*First organization to reach 2 million {{Abbr/USD}} in earnings.

